  {
    "id": 3943355172,
    "type": "DiffNote",
    "body": "Fixed in `a703572e3` (record `06ec25a35`).\n\n- Acceptance now claims the contract and rewrites the manifest in one transaction. Any failure rolls back and unloads the freight in memory, including a failed manifest write, which `vessel_db_save_cargo()` now reports.\n- The bond is debited only after `COMMIT`, then saved with `save_char_checked()`.\n- If that save fails, the gold is restored, the contract is reopened (only if still taken by this captain, through a prepared statement) and the freight is unloaded and re-saved. A SYSERR is logged if that compensation itself fails.\n- The player sees \"no gold was taken\" in both failure cases.\n\n`Test_vessel_freight_bond_pays_for_the_goods` (DB-backed) now covers:\n\n- a refused manifest write (a CHECK constraint on the fixture table);\n- a failed character save;\n- the success path, with the captain saved to a scratch player file.\n\nEach failure leaves gold, contract status and manifest unchanged. The test fails on the previous acceptance code. The local CI matrix passed all 33 jobs on `a703572e3`.",
    "author": {
